  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"486\" id=\"isPasted\">Green Llama is a purpose-driven brand making it easy (and fun!) for families to keep their homes clean while protecting the planet. Our non-toxic, refillable cleaning essentials—like all-purpose sprays, laundry powder, dish tabs, and alpaca dryer balls—come in zero-waste, compostable packaging that delivers real results without the guilt.</p><p data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"792\">What sets us apart? Our “Power of Positive Cleaning” approach and our llama mascot, Llaina, who turns everyday eco-actions into feel-good wins. As an affiliate, you’ll earn 10% commission on every sale made through your unique link or coupon code. Payments are made regularly via PayPal or bank transfer.</p><p data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"961\">We support our partners with branded visuals, helpful tips, and seasonal promos to help you grow. Join us in turning everyday cleaning into a superhero-worthy mission.</p></div></div>",
